    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Great Seer of Virud Lizardmen. He is an ardent follower of Fafurion. Being a powerful shaman, he believes that the Water Dragon Fafurion will lead the Lizardmen to a great day of glory. He does not know that Fafurion barely notices his people. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
